    This release closes the loop so the composed graph actually runs:
    PipelineStudio's run-remix handler now writes remix_view.current_spec()
    (the full edited graph — every add/remove included) via
    spec_remix.write_spec instead of re-deriving from the base spec_path/
    edits alone, which silently dropped every structural edit from the
    executed run; the base spec's top-level _spec_version/_comment metadata
    is re-merged in before writing so a composed run preserves it exactly
    like a param-only remix does.

