tt-local-generator (0.7.1) noble; urgency=medium

  * Fix scroll sluggishness: GLib.io_add_watch dead-pipe spin loop in
    workflow_popover.py._on_run_stdout. When readline() returned "" at pipe
    EOF, the old code returned SOURCE_CONTINUE before reaching the IO_HUP
    handler, leaving the dead fd in GLib's watch table and spinning the main
    loop on every idle iteration. Fixed by falling through to the IO_HUP
    check on empty reads so SOURCE_REMOVE is returned and the watch removed.

